href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D453\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(827.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1883.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Hz</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>So, the frequency of the wave is 330 Hz.</p>\n\n<p>Thus, the correct answer is:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Option C: 330 Hz</strong></p>","qKey":"lv3ve49a","paperKey":"jee-main-2024-online-8th-april-evening-shift","exam":"jee-main"}]}